From: genshanxinli <127909456+genshanxinli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:52:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] AP: lower unsolicited Link Measurement Report to debug

Clients may send unsolicited RRM Link Measurement Reports with no matching
outstanding request. Logging them at MSG_INFO floods the default syslog ring
on chatty 5 GHz clients despite requiring no action; demote to MSG_EXCESSIVE.

Origin: backport, archive/xr1710g-v1
Signed-off-by: genshanxinli <127909456+genshanxinli@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/src/ap/rrm.c
+++ b/src/ap/rrm.c
@@ -367,7 +367,7 @@ static void hostapd_handle_link_mesr_report(struct hostapd_data *hapd,
 
 	if (!hapd->link_mesr_req_active ||
 	    (hapd->link_measurement_req_token != report->dialog_token)) {
-		wpa_printf(MSG_INFO,
+		wpa_printf(MSG_EXCESSIVE,
 			   "Unexpected Link measurement report, token %u",
 			   report->dialog_token);
 		return;
